            "notes": "For this round, you wanna build up Survival. It's important you stay alive to deny the enemy team healing and to make money. \n\nFor a a little  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) , get either  [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) or  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) \n\nAdapt based on what enemy team is building,  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)  or   [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) ?\n\nTaking too much ability damage? Go for  [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214) \n\nToo much weapon damage? Go for  [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) \n\nPlay safe, heal when needed, and chuck those nades! Gotta utilize that cooldown reduction.",
