            "notes": "This round is for building more  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) . You have a LOT of options based on what enemy team is doing to you.\n\nCan't survive?  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) \n\nEnemies too fast?  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98)\n\nNeed more  [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) ?  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) or  [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4) .\n\nPick the best EPIC [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) to complement your  [Grenadius Pin](item_acd985cf-2e74-4e18-8fad-cdaa0837fc78) based on your current game!",
