            "notes": "Okay for powers here, again we need to pick based on what you and your team needs.\n\nAs always,  [No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6) is GREAT for increasing your healing output. Even with little to no [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power), having increased  [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) means you can heal **faster**.\n\n [Comfy Cloud](item_d975b671-2810-4ce3-a367-32b075c39f91) is a good pick because building  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)  means your sleep dart is always strong!\n\n [Time Out](item_34fc2f6c-ecd9-489e-98ca-d08f3eb2fac1) is good against dive/brawl characters like [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46),  [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1), and  [Lucio](hero_b38c5d54-a585-4545-b0b8-4d4b205b3768). This is what I usually pick. ALWAYS pair it with  [I.V. Drip](item_4993e9c9-738f-4aba-bfbf-c6247ff71af1) as your survival item!\n\nDitch your  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) for  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce). Get a survival item to live more.",
